pudding-ios — iOS 16.7.16 on the Xiaomi 17 (pudding, SM8850)

This repository contains only device-specific additions: kernel patches,
scripts, measurement notes and CI definitions. It does not redistribute
upstream code; the build fetches it from the projects below.

Upstream projects and their licenses
------------------------------------
- ShueiTsuki/data-a-live — Xiaomi 17 Pro (pandora) port. Kernel patches and
  the kernel-side drivers are APSL-2.0 (the license of Apple's xnu they patch);
  tools and documentation are MIT.
- dipa-studio/ios-sweet — the original XNU-on-Qualcomm port this lineage
  descends from.
- UniXNU/UniXNU — 4 KiB page support, NativeAdreno, NativeMetal, ArmSmmu4K.
  BSD-2-Clause-Patent.
- blacktop/darwin-xnu-build — the macOS build script used by CI.
- Apple Inc. — XNU kernel sources (APSL-2.0).

Not distributed here
--------------------
- Apple system files: IPSWs, SDKs, dyld shared caches, kernelcaches.
- Phone firmware and partition dumps.
- Device-unique data (IMEI, calibration).

Users obtain these from their own device and from Apple's public servers.
"iOS", "iPhone", "XNU" and "Apple" are named only to describe what the code
works with; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Apple.
